  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening policies for inclusive AI Digital Transformation in Mekong Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mekong countries are among the Member States that have taken advantage of the rapid evolution of ICTs and early adoption of digital tools. However, while the internet and digital transformation have brought benefits and opportunities to the society and the economy, the region also faces the challenges of ethical use of digital technologies, inclusive access and maintaining human agency over AI tools. UNESCO Bangkok will target AI capacity-building opportunities arising in the Mekong countries through support to government agencies and and regulators in charge of digital transformation and ICT policies as well as civil society stakeholders including journalists, jurists and legislators.</narrative>
  </description>
